{"sourceUrl":"https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/tmgc/info/1055/6460.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:06.667428+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/tmgc/info/1055/6460.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、拟接收推免生的专业</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1. </span></strong><strong><span>学术学位</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>081401 </span><span>岩土工程</span></p>\n<p><span>081402</span><span>结构工程</span></p>\n<p><span>081404</span><span>供热供燃气通风及空调工程</span></p>\n<p><span>081405</span><span>防灾减灾工程及防护工程</span></p>\n<p><span>081406</span><span>桥梁与隧道工程。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2. </span></strong><strong><span>专业学位</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>085901 </span><span>土木工程</span></p>\n<p><span>085906 </span><span>人工环境工程（含供热、通风及空调等）</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>获得推免资格的应届本科毕业生。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、资料审查</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>考生按</span><span>1-2</span><span>的顺序将下列材料合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档，并以</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span>报考专业</span><span>”</span><span>的方式命名，于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>20</span><span>日</span><span>12:00</span><span>前发至邮箱</span><span>tmyjs0768@163.com</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>、个人简介（含本科主修课程、四六级成绩、竞赛获奖等）；</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>、获得的推免生资格证明。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、咨询、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>电话：</span><span>0371-67781692</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、其他说明</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>本安排只是采集报考意向信息，全国推免服务系统（预计</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日）开放后，已具有推免资格的考生，须在系统中注册并填报志愿，根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>建议有意向报名我院的考生先与意向导师联系，并将个人简历发给意向导师，土木工程学院导师介绍请查看网址：</span><span>https://www5.zzu.edu.cn/tmgc/szdw/szgk.htm</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>报名咨询</span><span>QQ</span><span>群号：</span><span>811941701</span><span>。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div><div></div></div>","textSha256":"b696160ecdffda7dc2e53b41f2924badf1da18053113efd985fa4ba9341cf34a","textLength":510,"sourceSha256":"d7fe0c7f5018409885b728bc4a42daba8ecb9992b7a174015388044828f2805c","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5672e69d168cf92a399b","title":"2026年郑州大学土木工程学院2027年推荐免试研究生报考意向采集及材料提交工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:06.667428+00:00"}
